<title>USA: Clarcor Inc Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Clarcor Inc Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF EARNINGS</p>
<p>	   (Dollars in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>	   For periods ended November 30, and December 2</p>
<p>			    Fourth Quarter	  Twelve Months</p>
<p>			   1996	 1995	  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net sales	  $90,805     $85,750    $333,388    $290,194</p>
